# Public frontend config only (bundled into the client).
#
# Leave EMPTY for:
#   - local Vite (dev server proxies /api → local Express)
#   - Vercel production (root vercel.json proxies /api/* → Render)
# so the browser always calls same-origin /api/...
#
# Do NOT set this to the Render hostname in production if you want
# public URLs to stay https://cudasolutions.org/api/...
VITE_API_URL=
